WEBVTT

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:44.870
Shanghai...

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.610
We've finally come home.

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:09.060
Dammit! I don't understand it at all!

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:15.240
<i>I was sure I was in the future or maybe being</i>
<i>forced to be a mercenary on another planet.</i>

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:19.410
<i>Basically, that the whole thing was just</i>
<i>some super-realistic virtual reality game.</i>

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.510
<i>But what was that message all about?</i>

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.490
I should probably ask about
that the next time I go there.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.340
Wha?!

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:48.630
THIS IS IMPOSSIBLE!!!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.850
Ow! What the hell?

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.790
Zegapain...

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.520
Wait, what brought me here?

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:11.230
You still aren't used to using
your cereb-icon, are you, Kyo?

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.360
You got your transmission
coordinates wrong.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.800
Icon?

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.290
Oh, right. That shining thing
on my forehead.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:20.200
Huh? But then, when did I get this thing?

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.010
That's...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:24.010
No prob. It got me here, after all.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:27.110
So... Your name's Fosetta, right?

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.180
Yes.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.050
So, is Shizuno-sempai around?

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:34.040
Yes. She's in a meeting, though.
I'll take you to her.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:36.950
This way, please.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:58.510
N-N-N-No! No!
It's not what you think!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:02.780
So, did I react the way
a real human girl would?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.740
I'm just an A.I.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:12.420
If you're bored, we can talk
about the weather if you like.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:16.850
People talk about the weather in lieu
of greeting each other, don't they?

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.270
Believe it or not, that's my specialty.
Talking about the weather!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:26.260
Dammit! Why did you let him
out of the Zegapain?!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.640
How was I to know he'd do that?

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:31.940
The thing we've all been worrying
about is psychological damage to him!

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:38.410
He's fresh off a reboot and doesn't understand
who he is or what the world is <i>really</i> like!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:43.760
In the 24 hours since the incident, Sogoru
Kyo is only showing a psycho flux of plus two.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.390
Psychological damage is roughly zero.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.530
Thank you, Dita.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.770
Even if you weren't expecting it, he shouldn't
have been allowed out in his current state.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.140
So, whose fault is it
for our current condition?

00:04:56.140 --> 00:05:00.170
As commander of the Oceanus, I have
a duty to maintain our combat strength.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.680
That's not what he wanted.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.410
We all have to do things
we'd rather not do.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:07.970
Even me.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.410
And you!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.820
Are we through here?

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:16.160
Hold it!

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:18.790
If he isn't able to awaken
as well as we hope,

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.990
then you're free to explain
everything to him.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:24.690
I'll leave that decision
up to you, as his partner.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.600
Our greatest fear is that,
once he knows the truth,

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.170
he'll be so disturbed that
he'll disrupt an operation.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.760
Correct?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.070
As you wish.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.520
Kyo!

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:52.050
Shizuno-sempai!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.650
Kyo Sogoru!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.830
Huh? The student council
president and vice-president?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.170
I am the commander of the Oceanus.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.940
And I'm the first officer.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:08.640
Hm... So, the older students
play this game too, huh?

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.810
How did you get here?!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:14.280
Oh, I think I used that
glowy thing on my forehead.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:18.410
I was thinking about this place,
and suddenly here I was.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.910
Oh, yeah! I've got some
questions for you guys.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.390
About what?

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:27.260
The "battles" I've been fighting...
Can you tell me about them?

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:33.270
See, I've noticed I don't know who
I'm fighting or what I'm fighting for,

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.760
so I figured I should ask
this time around.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.610
Haven't you been using
the simulator enough?!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:42.700
Simu... Oh! You don't mean
that game, do you?

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:46.610
Everything you want to know is
programmed into the simulator.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:50.120
You mean that opening movie stuff?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:53.710
I think it'd be faster for you to
watch that than for us to explain it.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.590
Meaning I wasted this whole trip here?

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:58.890
Darn it, and after I learned how
to get here on my own, too.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.930
Not at all.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:04.560
Gaining control of your cereb-icon
is a major step forward.

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:07.870
Cereb-icon, huh?

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:21.640
Jeez... What's the deal?!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.980
You really like that game that much?

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.710
No... It's not... just that...

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:35.730
But the story doesn't continue
unless I clear each stage... Hey! Agh!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.500
Hey, Kaminagi.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:40.700
What?

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.570
You know any cheats?

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:52.950
Transmission, complete!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.310
All systems and main unit are in the green!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.850
Activity time limit: fifty-two minutes!

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.220
Uh-oh. Looks like we had a transmission glitch.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:06.320
This is the reserve point,
2 kilometers northwest of the target.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.670
<i>You want to try and recover</i>
<i>the Shanghai server?</i>

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:17.730
Yes, sir. We're just within
transmission range now.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.370
I understand how you feel,

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:23.580
but the Shanghai server
was destroyed. It's...

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.640
We're aware of that! Even so...

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:31.110
Even if it's impossible now, we may find
a way to recover the data in the future!

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:34.020
For that day, we have to try!

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.220
Commander, we're begging you!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:37.450
Please!

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.860
Very well, I'll approve it.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:43.850
Thank you so much!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.590
Commander, are you sure about this?

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.770
We need hope.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.970
Especially those who need to
believe in a future to fight for.

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:57.300
I'm coming for you...

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.980
Zegatank, move out!

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.920
Okay, come on! I see ya!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.850
The one on the right! Now the left!

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:08.660
No! Your cell phone hand!
Oh, not that way!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.560
Why, you... I gotcha! Hah!

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:13.460
- What are you doing?! You're getting hit!
- Whoa, careful!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:14.260
Am not!

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.400
Your energy! Your Q.L.!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.430
If your Q.L. hits zero, it's game over!

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.960
Then I'll beat 'em before it runs out!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.760
Stage four: clear.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.430
No way, you <i>punched it?</i>

00:09:50.430 --> 00:09:52.800
You punched in a shooting game?!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.470
So what? I won, didn't I?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.200
You don't get it.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.200
The essential point of a shooter
is for you to avoid getting shot!

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:03.280
When did you become such a big gamer?

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:07.370
First of all, the point of a game is to
have as much fun as possible, right?

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:12.450
A future locked away from us.
The loss of form.

00:10:12.450 --> 00:10:14.220
And the seed of transcendence.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:16.050
The battle with the Gards-orm continues.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:21.220
Cerebrants, you are our last hope!
Board your holonic loaders!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.930
My thoughts, never to be erased.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.900
My pain, never to be forgotten.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.140
Proceeding to stage 5.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:32.100
Do you wish to play?

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:35.470
Hey, are you gonna do it or not?
Continue?

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.500
Here.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:45.120
Great. I didn't learn anything.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:46.640
If you won't play, I will.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.000
What the!

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.950
A deutera zone!

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.350
What's it doing here?

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:22.220
It's already pretty big.

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:24.560
Oh! Of course!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:27.390
This is what caused the transmission glitch!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:32.370
I confirm the Shanghai server is about
to be swallowed by the deutera zone!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.500
What did you say?!

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:34.430
<i>Warning!</i>

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.340
Gards-orm mobile squadron is closing on us!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.570
Zegatank assuming battle mode!

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:42.300
Zegatank combat operation limit:
25 minutes, 30 seconds!

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:45.070
Arm antiaircraft weaponry!
Deploy phalanx shot!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.250
<i>Caladrius has confirmed an</i>
<i>M-class deutera zone...</i>

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.380
<i>while approaching the Shanghai server.</i>

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.350
<i>Currently engaging enemy mobile squadron!</i>

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.890
<i>Zegapain Garuda, you are ordered to scramble!</i>

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:03.990
May-yu...

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:07.870
<i>Initiating countdown. Transmission</i>
<i>scatter rate confirmed and compensated.</i>

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:11.730
<i>Transmission port energy compilation at 83%.</i>

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.340
<i>26 seconds to replenishment.</i>

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:16.070
<i>Quantum transmission core, all normal.</i>

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.010
<i>Transmission scatter rate, green.</i>

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:20.380
<i>Restoration coordinates, set!</i>

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.110
<i>Transmitting Zegapain Garuda!</i>

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:23.770
Entangle!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.370
Holonic armor reaction!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:46.200
Increased Q.L. consumption has shortened
our operation time by 12 seconds!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.780
I can see it! Shanghai server!

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.680
<i>Warning!</i>

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.210
On collision course with the Aanvals!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.120
We're going to hit them!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.070
Lu-shen! May-yen!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.830
Get going! There's no time!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:15.390
Thank you!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.370
Deutera zone will reach the
Shanghai server in 920 seconds!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.940
Looks like we'll have to destroy
the core before that happens!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:39.830
<i>So, in the end...</i>

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:44.160
<i>I have no idea who or what</i>
<i>I'm not supposed to believe.</i>

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.670
Shizuno-sempai?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:49.870
There's an emergency.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.070
Come.

00:13:52.070 --> 00:13:53.200
W-W-W-W-Wait a minute!

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:57.370
THIS IS IMPOSSIBLE!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.080
So, in short, I just have destroy the core...

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.290
before the deutera zone reaches
the Shanghai whats-it, right?

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.220
Right. Can you do it?

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:14.290
Just leave this to me! I've cleared up
through stage four on the simulator!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:18.630
Well, that's impressive!
That just leaves 196 more to go.

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.900
Until you're off the beginner level, at least.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.200
<i>Beginner?</i>

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.760
Shanghai server is 400 meters ahead!

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.350
I know.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.660
I know very...

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:56.270
Ricerca, deploy the cannon!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.000
Roger!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.330
Physicalizing quantum transmission chamber.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.670
Commence materialization of holonic cannon!

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.610
There's no end to them!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.430
Altair?!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.030
Kyo Sogoru!

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.340
Combat operation limit: 15 minutes, 20 seconds.

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:40.570
Deutera zone will reach the
Shanghai server in 380 seconds!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:41.600
Hurry!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.180
Outta the way! Comin' through!

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.530
Be careful, Kyo.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:58.790
Holonic armor may be the ultimate
shielding, but our Q.L. reserves are limited.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.500
I know, but there's no time to waste!

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.950
The deutera zone is now 110
seconds from the Shanghai server.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.280
All right! We made it!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.290
You guys are set on not letting us pass, huh?

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:32.730
2 minutes, 15 seconds to combat operation limit.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.170
You're using too much Q.L.!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.130
In that case!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.650
Shanghai server, in sight!

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:02.590
Hi, guys...

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.830
I'm home.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.460
I'm going to save you now.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.860
Deutera zone is now 100 seconds away!

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:21.810
How much time is left?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.020
40 seconds.

00:17:24.550 --> 00:17:26.720
But we barely have any Q.L. left.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.020
We've failed.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:29.710
I won't...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.520
I WON'T JUST GIVE UP!!!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.660
What do you plan to do?

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.030
You can't use any weapons before we time out!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.430
I'm gonna use the weapons every man has!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:07.490
No way! But it worked in the game!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.190
Come... ON!!!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.070
I almost have it... Almost!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:32.890
I did it!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.220
Deutera zone approaching!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.460
DAMMIT ALL!!!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:09.620
Out of the way, Kyo Sogoru!

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.720
Oh, sister!

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:59.470
Look, I know how much this sucks.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:03.910
But, come on, we did everything
we possibly could!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.410
Okay, so we failed on this round.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:11.320
But channel how upset you
are into the next game.

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.910
We'll get our revenge on them then!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:26.330
What the hell was that for...

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.840
H- Hey! What's this all about?! HEY!

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.440
Come with me.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:43.650
God, what was his problem?!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:45.510
Just hauling off and hitting me like that!

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:48.010
Do you want to know?

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:49.950
Look.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.370
Does this look like a game to you?

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:03.340
Like an artificial world?

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:07.570
This is all real. Everything is.

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:54.210
You have many questions that are confusing you.

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:57.740
You now realize the illusion
that you've been trapped in.

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:00.550
Harsh battle and peaceful, ordinary life...

00:23:00.550 --> 00:23:02.920
The two worlds like a dream to each other.

00:23:02.920 --> 00:23:06.830
If one of them is reality,
then the other must be fiction.

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:08.560
Go into battle, Kyo!

00:23:08.560 --> 00:23:12.530
Only at the end of the battle
can you face the cruel reality.

00:23:12.930 --> 00:23:15.790
Next time, on Zegapain: "Déjà Vu."

00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:18.330
My thoughts, never to be erased.
